            </note>
            <note corresp="#d51-f2" n="13" xml:id="d51-f2-content">
                <p>Implementation of these capabilities depends upon assessments relative to
                    competing weapons. Assumed no fiscal constraints but conservative development
                    approach. [Footnote is in the original.]</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d51-f3" n="14" xml:id="d51-f3-content">
                <p>Believed prototype projects underway. [Footnote is in the original.]</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d51-f4" n="15" xml:id="d51-f4-content">
                <p>Believed prototype projects underway. [Footnote is in the original.]</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d51-f5" n="16" xml:id="d51-f5-content">
                <p>Believed prototype projects underway. [Footnote is in the original.]</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
